00:15:45.390 --> 00:15:48.450
except the light that's coming through the lens here.

00:15:48.950 --> 00:15:54.390
And to make a photograph, we want to control how much light hits the film.

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:59.980
And one of the ways we do that is through the shutter.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:07.390
When the shutter is open for more time, more light hits the film.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:13.540
And when the shutter is open for less time, less light hits the film.

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:19.680
Another way of controlling how much light you're allowed to hit the film is with the iris on the lens.

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:21.910
