00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:26.660
The iris is sort of like the pupils of your eyes.

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:46.430
You know like if you go outside in the sun and it's really bright, the pupils in your eyes will get really small or if you go inside and it's really dark, your pupils will get really wide and that's sort of what this iris on the lens does.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:50.430
It allows more light to come into the camera to hit the film.

