00:23:35.350 --> 00:23:40.430
His shadow swims underwater, dancing and shaking, and never holding still.

00:23:41.620 --> 00:23:47.140
Sometimes the boy's shadow is so tall, it can touch the treetops.

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:50.600
And sometimes it's short and chubby.

00:23:52.100 --> 00:23:57.700
The best thing about having a shadow is that you can tell all your secrets,

00:23:57.900 --> 00:23:59.780
and you know that they'll be safe.

