this one will take some practice once you've got the hang of it

00:24:30.220 --> 00:24:31.840
You can make up your own stories.

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:35.640
Like you could make a snake looking for dinner.

00:24:36.430 --> 00:24:37.290
What would he eat?

00:24:38.040 --> 00:24:41.080
Not a kangaroo, maybe a rabbit.

00:24:42.400 --> 00:24:44.600
I'm Michael Sanchez and I had fun with this book.

00:24:44.700 --> 00:24:45.640
I hope you will too.

